<title>USA: US corn gluten values flat, some out of meal.</title>
<headline>US corn gluten values flat, some out of meal.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten meal and pellet values were unchanged Wednesday in active trading, but some dealers said recent heavy trade left them with no gluten meal.</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   97.00     97.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     May	-   unq	345.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   89.00     89.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  350.00    350.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
